# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002221> (surrounds)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002221> "inverse of surrounded by")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002221> "surrounds"@en)
