AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002243> "A broad relationship between an exposure event or process and the course takes from the source to the target.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002243> "has exposure transport path")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002243> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002244>)

