AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002572> "s is luminal space of x iff s is lumen_of x and s is an immaterial entity")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002572> "luminal space of")
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002572> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002571>)
