AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0020101> "x vessel supplies blood to y if and only if x is a vessel that supplies blood directly or indirectly to an anatomical structure y.")
