# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_167670> (SCH772984)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_167670> "A member of the class of indazoles that is 1<em>H</em>-indazole substituted by pyridin-4-yl and {[(3<i>R</i>)-1-(2-oxo-2-{4-[4-(pyrimidin-2-yl)phenyl]piperazin-1-yl}ethyl)pyrrolidin-3-yl]carbonyl}amino groups at positions 3 and 5, respectively. It is a potent inhibitor of mitogen-activated protein kinases ERK1 and ERK2 (IC<small><sub>50</sub></small> = 4 and 1 nM, respectively) that exhibits anti-cancer properties.")
