# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_231342> (ceralasertib)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_231342> "Ceralasertib is an orally available morpholino-pyrimidine-based inhibitor of ataxia telangiectasia and rad3 related (ATR) kinase, with potential antineoplastic activity. Upon oral administration, Ceralasertib selectively inhibits ATR activity by blocking the downstream phosphorylation of the serine/threonine protein kinase CHK1. This prevents ATR-mediated signaling, and results in the inhibition of DNA damage checkpoint activation, disruption of DNA damage repair, and the induction of tumor cell apoptosis.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_231342> "CHEBI:231342")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_231342> "ceralasertib")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_231342> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_50860>)

