# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24279> (glucosinolate)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24279> "Water-soluble anionic substituted thioglucosides. Glucosinolates have a central C atom which is bonded via an S atom to a glycone group and via an N atom to a sulfonated oxime group, and which also carries a side-group. The side-chain and sulfate group have an <i>anti</i> stereochemical configuration across the C=N double bond.")
