# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27300> (vitamin D)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27300> "Any member of a group of fat-soluble hydroxy seco-steroids that exhibit biological activity against vitamin D deficiency. Vitamin D  can be obtained from sun exposure, food and supplements and is biologically inactive and converted into the biologically active calcitriol via double hydroxylation in the body.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27300> "CHEBI:27300")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_27300> "vitamin D")
