# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_60607> (metalaxyl-M)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_60607> "A methyl <em>N</em>-(2,6-dimethylphenyl)-<em>N</em>-(methoxyacetyl)alaninate that is the more active <i>R</i>-enantiomer of metalaxyl. A systemic fungicide, it is active against phytopathogens of the order <em>Peronosporales</em> and is used to conrtrol <em>Pythium</em> in a number of vegetable crops.")
