# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_63613> (nevirapine)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_63613> "A dipyridodiazepine that is  5,11-dihydro-6<em>H</em>-dipyrido[3,2-<em>b</em>:2',3'-<em>e</em>][1,4]diazepine which is substituted by methyl, oxo, and cyclopropyl groups at positions 4, 6, and 11, respectively. A non-nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitor with activity against HIV-1, it is used in combination with other antiretrovirals for the treatment of HIV infection.")
