AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_66682> "A pentacyclic triterpenoid that is olean-12-ene substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 2 and 3 and a carboxy group at position 28 (the 2α,3β stereoisomer). It is isolated from <em>Olea europaea</em> and <em>Salvia canariensis</em> and exhibits anti-inflammatory, antioxidant and antineoplastic activity.")
