# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81788> (cymoxanil)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81788> "A member of the class of ureas that is urea in which the two nitrogen atoms are substituted by an ethyl group and a 2-cyano-2-(methoxyimino)acetyl group respectively. A fungicide used to control <em>Peronosporales</em> on a range of crops including vines, hops and potatoes.")
