AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81922> "An organosilicon compound that is dimethylsilane in which the hydrogens attached to the silicon are replaced by <em>p</em>-fluorophenyl groups and a hydrogen attached to one of the methyl groups is replaced by a 1<em>H</em>-1,2,4-triazol-1-yl group. It is a broad-sepctrum fungicide used to protect a variety of crops.")
