AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_94288> "A 2-amino-4-(<em>S</em>-butylsulfonimidoyl)butanoic acid which has <i>S</i>-configuration. It is a inhibitor of γ-glutamylcysteine synthetase and glutathione (GSH) biosynthesis and is capable of enhancing the apoptotic effects of several chemotherapeutic agents.")
