# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000341> (piece of gravel)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gravel") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000341> "A piece of rock which is between two and 64 millimetres in length along its largest dimension."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000341> "Arguably, this could be placed in the \"particle\" hierarchy, but is usually considered too large in everyday semantics."@en)
