AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_00000428> "In this definition, there is an assumption that no major perturbations are occurring or have occurred in a time frame affects the successional dynamics of the ecosystem. A \"major\" perturbation is one which disrupts the community's ability to restore its (near) equilibrium. Usually, pioneer or early secondary successional processes would be in effect in such scenarios."@en)
