AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000203> "A condition defines a restricted range of a given quality or combination of qualities. If an environment class, E, has_condition C, then all qualities listed in C are restricted to the ranges defined in C in E. This is not intended as a logical conditional.")
