AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000792> "This class refers to all forms of \"wind\": from the familiar movement of air in the Earth's atmosphere to the solar wind. Use a subclass to be more precise.")
