AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001069> "While this class allows for some degree of contamination by non-metal substances, the material represented should show at least some of the typical features of a pure metal: hardness (except for liquid metals), opacity, lustre, malleability, fusibility, ductile  and good electrical and thermal conductivity.")
