# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001436> (planned environmental usage process)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001436> "A planned process during which humans access and obtain resources, benefits, or services from a natural or anthropised ecosystem.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001436> "planned environmental usage process"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01001436> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_01000952>))
