# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000127> (acid rainfall)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acid_rain") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ENVO_03000127> "A water-based rainfall process during which water droplets with increased acidity fall towards a planetary surface.")
