AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002448> "A zucchini food product is a food product deriving from either golden or green zucchini plant cultivars."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002448> "zucchini food product"@en)
