# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> (vanilla bean extract)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> "Vanilla extract is a solution containing the flavor compound vanillin as the primary ingredient.  It is made by macerating and percolating vanilla pods in a solution of ethanol and water."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> "natural vanilla"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> "Wikipedia notes: Pure vanilla extract is made by macerating and percolating vanilla pods in a solution of ethanol and water. 

In the United States, in order for a vanilla extract to be called pure, the U.S. Food and Drug Administration requires that the solution contains a minimum of 35% alcohol and 100 g of vanilla beans per litre (13.35 ounces per gallon).

Canadian Regulations: Under the Food and Drug Regulations (C.R.C., c. 870), vanilla extract products have to be processed from vanilla beans: Vanilla planifolia or Vanilla tahitensia."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> "vanilla bean extract"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_18346> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_48408>)) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002353> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002414>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002328>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000051> ObjectUnionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_18346> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_48408>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316764> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00001301> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002396>))
