* milk (mammary secretion) UBERON:0001913
* full fat removal process FOODON:03460248
* preservation by heat treatment FOODON:03470120
* pasteurization by heating FOODON:03470135"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03317575> "skim milk (pasteurized)"@en)
