AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401306> "Yeast, algae, or fungus based dietary supplement."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401306> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=A1306>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401306> "LanguaL curation note: Use for supplements based on plants, yeast, algae, and fungi (index in facet B).
If the supplement also contains vitamins or minerals use the appropriate descriptor under * DIETARY SUPPLEMENT, COMBINATION*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401306> "dietary supplement, botanical"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401306> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401298>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> (probiotic or bacteria supplement)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> "Probiotics are live microorganisms thought to be healthy for the host organism. According to the currently adopted definition by FAO/WHO, probiotics are selected \"live microorganisms which when administered in adequate amounts confer a health benefit on the host\".[FAO/WHO (2001) Health and Nutritional Properties of Probiotics in Food including Powder Milk with Live Lactic Acid Bacteria. Report of a Joint FAO/WHO Expert Consultation on Evaluation of Health and Nutritional Properties of Probiotics in Food Including Powder Milk with Live Lactic Acid Bacteria]  
Lactic acid bacteria (LAB) and bifidobacteria are the most common types of microbes used as probiotics; but also certain yeasts and bacilli are available. [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Probiotics]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=A1308>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> "LanguaL curation note: Currently not used in US classification of dietary supplements."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> "probiotic or bacteria supplement"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401306>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401308> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03401309>)

