SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00005501>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411297>)

