# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411206> (plum plant)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411206> "A plum is a fruit of the subgenus *Prunus* of the genus *Prunus*. The subgenus is distinguished from other subgenera (peaches, cherries, bird cherries, etc.) in the shoots having terminal bud and solitary side buds (not clustered), the flowers in groups of one to five together on short stems, and the fruit having a groove running down one side and a smooth stone (or pit)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411206> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B1206>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411206> "plum plant"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411206> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411539>)

