AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411555> <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?312013>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411555> <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=26857>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411555> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B1555>)
