AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420102> "A seed which has germinated and put out shoots."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420102> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0102>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420102> "germinated or sprouted seed"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420102> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03304313>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420102> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420133>)

