# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420108> (sugar)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420108> "A broad term that includes the nutritive sweeteners dextrose, fructose, galactose, lactose, maltose and sucrose, which are simple carbohydrates with molecules composed of one or two saccharide units. Note that on a product label or in a recipe, 'sugar' means *SUCROSE* and should be so indexed. Use the broad term *SUGAR* only if the specific sugar used is not known or not listed in the vocabulary."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420108> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0108>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420108> "sugar"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420108> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420152>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420109> (thymus or pancreas)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420109> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0109>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420109> "thymus or pancreas"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420109> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420218>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420113> (mammalian milk or milk component)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420113> "A broad term that includes milk and its components, cream, curd and whey; use the appropriate specific term when milk or a milk product is the principal ingredient. Use the appropriate term under *MEAT ANIMAL* to index the source of the milk (note: 21 CFR 131.110 defines milk as cow's milk)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420113> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0113>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420113> "LanguaL curation note: For 'whole milk' combine *MILK OR MILK PRODUCT* (A. PRODUCT TYPE) with *MILK* (C. PART OF PLANT OR ANIMAL); for 'lowfat cottage cheese' combine *UNCURED CHEESE* (A. PRODUCT TYPE) with *CURD* (C. PART OF PLANT OR ANIMAL) and *FAT PARTIALLY REMOVED* (H. TREATMENT APPLIED)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420113> "mammalian milk or milk component"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420113> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03315150>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> (organism material)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> "Material which is distinguished primarily by the organism(s) it derives from."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B0001>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B1564>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0116>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> "LanguaL curation note: \"e.g. *LEAF*, *ROOT OR TUBER*, *ORGAN MEAT*, *MILK* OR *EGG*; it also includes components of parts, such as *CREAM*, and extracts, concentrates or isolates, such as *PROTEIN EXTRACT* or *SUGAR*.\""@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> "Old definition as of Feb 25, 2025: Anatomical or other part(s) or substances derived from plant or animal or fungal organisms."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> "organism material"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000040>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420122> (nonmeat part of animal)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420122> "A piece of an animal which is not meat, namely a bone, feather, shell, skin or trim fat."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420122> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0122>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420122> "LanguaL curation note: *BLOOD* AND *INK, AQUATIC ANIMAL* are now listed under organism substance."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420122> "nonmeat part of animal"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420122> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00004332>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420127> (animal (whole or piece(s)))

AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420127> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=C0127>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420127> "This is from a LanguaL \"ANIMAL BODY OR BODY PART\" class. Its subclasses can be used if it is ambiguous what animal is being referred to, and whether the reference is being made to a whole animal or some part of it, including parts of organs.  However, see if a more precise term is available under either the \"animal carcass\" branch or the \"piece of animal\"branch.

LanguaL curation note: Includes carcass meat, organ meat, and nonmeat parts of animals, as well as the whole animal."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420127> "animal (whole or piece(s))"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420127> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420164>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03420129> (cardiovascular system organ)

