AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005576> "Note that this term is intended to annotate gene products that are not attached to the cell surface. For gene products at the cell surface, consider annotating to external side of plasma membrane ; GO:0009897.")
